@startuml seq_rate_review_activity
!include style.iuml
title Rate & Review Activity

actor Traveller
participant "Android App" as App
participant "Auth & Profile\nService" as Auth
participant "Activity & Review\nService" as Activities
participant "Itinerary\nEngine" as Engine
database MongoDB

Traveller -> App : taps Rate on an activity
App --> Traveller : rating dialog (Submit disabled until a star is chosen)
Traveller -> App : chooses 1-5 stars, optional review and tags, taps Submit
opt location is allowed
  App -> App : reads the device's current position (Fused Location Provider)
end
App -> Activities : POST /api/activities/{activityId}/reviews { rating, comment, tags, location? }
Activities -> Auth : verifySessionToken(token): userId
alt rating, comment, tags or location invalid
  Activities --> App : 400 { error, details }
  App --> Traveller : shows the problem in the dialog
end
Activities -> MongoDB : findActivity(activityId): Activity | null
alt activity does not exist
  Activities --> App : 404 { error: "Activity not found" }
  App --> Traveller : shows the error in the dialog
end
Activities -> MongoDB : findReview(activityId, userId): Review | null
opt no verified review yet, and the position is within 150 m of the place
  Activities -> Engine : isScheduledOn(userId, activityId, today): boolean
  Engine -> MongoDB : findItinerary(the traveller's or their groups' trips with this stop today)
end
note right of Activities : verified when both hold;\na verified review stays verified when edited
alt traveller already reviewed this activity
  Activities -> MongoDB : updateReview(review, rating, comment, tags, verified)
else first review
  Activities -> MongoDB : createReview(activityId, userId, rating, comment, tags, verified)
end
Activities -> MongoDB : incrementCounters(activityId, reviewCount, ratingSum, verifiedReviewCount,\n verifiedRatingSum, reportedDuration, tagCounts)
Activities -> MongoDB : findActivity(activityId), findCatalogue(cityKey)
Activities -> Activities : communityScore(activity, cityMeanRating) (verified reviews count double),\ncommunityTags(tagCounts), visitMinutes(reports)
Activities --> App : 201 (new) or 200 (edited) { review, activity }
App --> Traveller : card shows the new score and tags; "Thanks! Your review of <activity> was saved."\n(and "It has a Verified visit badge and counts double." when verified)
@enduml
